      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "torchtitan/models/qwen3/README.md",
      "patch": "@@ -16,7 +16,9 @@ Model architectures exist for 4B, 8B, and 235B-A22B, but those sizes do not\n yet have verified training recipes.\n \n ## Download Qwen3 tokenizer\n-```python scripts/download_hf_assets.py --repo_id <hf_repo_name> --assets tokenizer```\n+```bash\n+python scripts/download_hf_assets.py --repo_id <hf_repo_name> --assets tokenizer\n+```\n \n For example, the 0.6B and 1.7B repositories are `Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B` and\n `Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B`. The conventional local directory is",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/torchtitan/raw/6931408f02dc113847bdc0eb0e391ea93c9a784c/torchtitan%2Fmodels%2Fqwen3%2FREADME.md",
